{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_020_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c95d42e2422c951d1ec426d93450525972d19826ebd3fd93efcf523b30f12fcb",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_020_22:5_01_020_22_a:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d71ccba8228ec2a2c6d8a5bc88e0f7d10b860cb54d60b1e92f24dc5069145ec",
      "text": "欸！？这个巧克力是给我的！？ ●●●●プロデューサー，谢谢你！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_020_22:5_01_020_22_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0152db5c8eca3c08834b344ed4078c2dbf2a1feb24eb6dde9c6ff36b13593fb2",
      "text": "居然特意为我准备了巧克力，我太开心了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_020_22:5_01_020_22_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f10f4d8a527ee1a31fd061f51638c3e51d73c344fe7785be146222deb72edfa3",
      "text": "这个我会珍惜着吃的。 真的太谢谢你了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_020_22:5_01_020_22_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e25566e83bba82b731ec19e42a1e37af23a07c6cc20ec11249168630c9bc996f",
      "text": "多亏了●●●●プロデューサー，训练课的 疲惫全都一扫而空啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_020_22:5_01_020_22_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9c0fcebb134278215e232c347c17ccf1e131769d972e3361c2c5d105843c0aa",
      "text": "吃了这份巧克力，从明天起我也要继续加油！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_020_22:5_01_020_22_b:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6fb0e9db58582df80a21608ac3a56507ccefaa130b4d8d95765ef8a2719d8ef",
      "text": "哇啊，是巧克力……！ 谢谢你，●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_020_22:5_01_020_22_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cc36659d1f46d204ce6d4502893eb906927fd6318db8870c2f1cb2f2f514bee",
      "text": "能收到制作人送的 情人节巧克力，超级开心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_020_22:5_01_020_22_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d5844d8b04013b39a89fedf6223d79be92c9ebef2bd64539eba830848ed4dca",
      "text": "在情人节收到巧克力这种事， 居然真的会发生啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_020_22:5_01_020_22_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1529f4d8390ee977e1a0f05faf8c20c707ca7e8b3100aff648a4635853c4407",
      "text": "而且还是●●●●プロデューサー送的！ 嘿嘿，我要去跟老哥炫耀一下♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_020_22:5_01_020_22_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b98b3e409263bc550e565a6d5ebe80065bb65490e5e5af96bea669b7d1712e5d",
      "text": "原来收到巧克力是这么让人开心的事啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_020_22:5_01_020_22_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6207ab704aacf27ffa66ead46334fc9161b668fb497b0ccfc2ab040f14cc8443",
      "text": "啊，早知道我也给●●●●プロデューサー 准备点什么就好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_020_22:5_01_020_22_b:cmd-000043:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6483652545bccda46d03462273ac1cd0bd717a82a0de18958140c6d251176af",
      "text": "别放在心上。你能开心我就很满足了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_020_22:5_01_020_22_b:cmd-000044:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77e7120ef6ffc1e3d96bc060840738dd273c1973454f279ed45b28e2e67d3971",
      "text": "哪里哪里，你能喜欢就太好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_020_22:5_01_020_22_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4796f47eb7d3bfd301ff7aca1a0c22ad8bf35f069f0c4f883cbb2b18091ac31",
      "text": "欸嘿嘿，这样啊…… 那你就好好期待白色情人节的回礼吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_020_22:5_01_020_22_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39ad93da53a9569dc03f69999fa346708df8d4593e9d9077b9fcee0f4040778e",
      "text": "为了让●●●●プロデューサー开心， 我一定会挑一份最棒的礼物的！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
